{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_0_level_main_00-10_beg",
  "groupId": "main_0",
  "stageId": "main_00-10",
  "title": "Dilemma",
  "storyCode": "0-10",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6a752ba1bb08444d995cf20c34a32a4fd0ba237f53a6a5e2a82ecce2c00ecb68",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "What's with this woman...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "...You there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "The Reunion forces worked like a well-oiled machine when they took over the Chernobog military strongholds.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "But your men act like deranged thugs.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Mindless slaughter, burning down the city, hunting down innocents... This was all for your own sadistic pleasure, was it not?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Someone base enough to plot these senseless crimes at a time like this... could not possibly have designed the plan to take down an entire city.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Your commander probably ordered you to cause chaos, but you succumbed to your perversion and tastelessness.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "...Faust.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "I want her shot through the mouth.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "*cough* *cough*...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Nearl!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Their sniper... is ridiculous!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "If Nearl gets hit again, she won't be able to defend herself anymore!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Nearl, you need to retreat!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "I can't... He's too powerful. I can't afford to let him hit our squads.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "I have to intercept his attacks!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "She managed to block Faust's ballista... with only a shield--?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Unbelievable... Impossible!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Do it again!! Blow her to pieces!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "--!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "What... it's coming from my right? !",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Oh no! Hurry, dodge--",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "As if I'd let you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Ace!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Snipers, take aim!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Target the raised platform to the south. Fire!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "What?! How dare you... How dare you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Did we get him?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "I doubt it. The most we can hope for... is to put some pressure on him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Unfortunately, we don't have the time to dissect our enemies' tactics.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "He's very mobile and has high firepower. The longer this drags on, the less likely we'll be able to block his shots!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "We can't give him time to set up...! Amiya, make your move while Team E3's Snipers keep him occupied!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Understood!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Team E1 Snipers, come with me and suppress Reunion's forces!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Team E2, use all the firepower you have to break through their defensive line!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "You filthy vermin...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Why won't you just obediently roll over and die?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "Why can't I just put an end to you all right here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mephisto",
      "text": "...I want to kill... every... single... one... of you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Nearl, now's your chance! Hurry!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "All members of Team E4, we're going to break through their formation!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "We're going to clear everything out of our way in one fell swoop!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Let's run wild!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Fire! Fire! Don't let her get any closer...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Huh...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "What?! She was twenty meters away just a moment ago...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Guhh... Aaarrghh!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "If you wish to stand against a Kazimierz knight, come back after you've trained a few more decades.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nearl",
      "text": "Dobermann! Follow me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "text": "Understood!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
